1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,648
Chalked up blurry, glare-heavy night vision and dry, gritty eyes to just getting older?

2
00:00:04,968 --> 00:00:09,190
Soda spikes blood sugar, linked to cataracts and macular degeneration.

3
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:13,883
Add lutein-rich kale too - it has 25 times more lutein than carrots.

4
00:00:14,203 --> 00:00:18,920
Fried food's another - one 18-year study found it triples that late-stage risk.

5
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:22,939
Add salmon too - its omega-3s help slow that progression.

6
00:00:23,259 --> 00:00:27,357
Scrolling in the dark cuts blink rate to under 8, raising dry eye risk.

7
00:00:27,677 --> 00:00:32,752
Try the 20-20-20 rule - every 20 minutes, look 20 feet away for 20 seconds.

8
00:00:33,072 --> 00:00:37,528
Macular damage is hard to reverse - start with what you eat and how you scroll.
